ow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường cao của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên phương trình tổng quát của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><m